Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am near my limit, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the same thing \Ngoes for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:12.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you can hide your \Ndecaying body with clothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.05,0:00:14.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you cannot disguise the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hohenheim...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:20.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the first time in hundreds of years \Nthat we've seen each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should have a nice long talk with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:30.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I haven't even \Ntried out this young body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I have had husbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:39.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Many, many, many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't, then the secret of my slowly aging body would have become known.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me, Trisha was my first and my last—\Nthe first woman I ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Four hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when we first met, \Nand I didn't know any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you whispered words of love to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:01.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps I'm remembering wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:03.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On that day, four hundred years ago, \Nwe finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were those who had escaped the witch hunts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and those who were just waiting for death from the black plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:24.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over and over, we used their lives \Nin our experiments
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:26.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and obtained a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:56.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the reaction from that transmutation left you nearly dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:02:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so using the Philosopher's Stone, I bonded your soul to the body of another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, we had obtained eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, you've used \Nthe Philosopher's Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to transfer your souls around \Nover and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't mean... \Nthe whole reason why
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you had us seek out someone who could make a Philosopher's Stone was...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I found that it became necessary, once Hohenheim of Light left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? Why did you \Ndisappear from my sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:41.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there is no such thing \Nas eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain it are set free from the Law of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:59.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no need to pay a price \Nin order to obtain something, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:04.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We sought it and found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:52.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aah! You can't put that much salt in, and you've got too much cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:05:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cooking is a science, \Njust like making Automail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to make things exact and according to calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And with this newly made oven of mine, \Nit will turn out perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:11.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this knob, you can adjust it to whatever temperature you want in a snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has a timer function you can set for the right number of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has this heat-resistant glass, so you can see what's happening inside at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cooking is an art.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It takes imagination and a sense of adventure that cannot be pigeonholed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:26.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cooking is a science!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's not. It's an art!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:35.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a guest, so you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.49,0:05:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, we're like family now—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and answer that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:38.90,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? The Elric brothers are there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shaw-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Their voice was strange for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.07,0:06:02.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but they said their name \Nwas Shaw-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shaw-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, they said to tell you \Nthey'd like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:11.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever you came back here would be fine, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And another thing—they were crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm! Wow, that looks delicious! Brother is going to be thrilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to \Nyour clothes? Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, just went on a little outing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made it look like we were setting out to head north.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I deliberately left some eyewitnesses, and on the way back, I fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I should have gone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.53,0:06:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what if you really {\i1}were{\i0} \Ndiscovered by the homunculi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, did anything happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We seem to have gotten a strange phone call a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:07:00.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nobody we know! It was probably \Nthe police trying to find us, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:05.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:23.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who recommended \NEdward Elric to be a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What shame he has brought to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we certain that the boy was \Nconnected with the uprising in Liore?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to the report, a year ago in Liore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he exposed a priest of Leto \Nwho had been misusing alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:42.55,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,However, the truth of the matter is, \Nthe priest continued to thrive following that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and consequently, a situation arose \Nwhere we had to intervene militarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:52.24,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,That intervention was overzealously enforced, and the civilians turned against the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you criticizing my mission strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:07:58.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking at Colonel Mustang's \Nservice record,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it is clear that he is an excellent soldier who has sworn his loyalty to the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:14.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do not understand why you would put \Na halt to the search for the Elric brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:18.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We thought the Elric brothers would return to their home,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:21.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so we put out a \Ndragnet in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, they appear to have gone straight north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,North? To Drachma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:30.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's it! They're in contact with those savages, are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Armstrong's squad has begun a search in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I have learned of \Nan even more serious matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which is why I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A serious matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you like, I could have everyone step outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, this is about your secretary, Captain Juliet Douglas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, this is sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She is on leave right now. \NWhat about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have serious doubts \Nabout her military service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, there is a possibility that she was involved in the circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:08.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,surrounding the murder of Brigadier General Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:14.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you certain of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:44.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a crush on her, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:00.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, we all heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gone and done \Nsomething bold again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you deliberately \Ndo something to provoke him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whether or not \Nthe Führer is a homunculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, those who call themselves homunculi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:20.65,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,have spent a long time sacrificing human lives \Nto create a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then there is a possibility that the civil war in Ishbal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was engineered in order to \Nbring about a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They would intentionally start a war?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:34.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is it that people seek the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Riches... glory... domination...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:40.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eternal life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When a person loses \Nthose who are around them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and is caught up in despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they seek the Philosopher's Stone \Nas their only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the \Nirregular conditions of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:11:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the morals that say that one must not sacrifice the lives of others vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is true that ever since \Nthe current Führer took power,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the country has been at war \Nsomewhere or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And we've won every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:11.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have any complaints over going to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when it's about making people stand at the brink of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in order to get a \NPhilosopher's Stone created...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed! Al! How long are you \Ngoing to sleep in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:44.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A simple chemical reaction like this \Nis one of the fundamentals of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:11:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me, Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I encased Al snugly inside bronze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't any seams, so as long as \Nthey don't break it in half,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's no way \Nthey'll know it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're leaving again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.07,0:12:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something \Nthat we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know! You're going to \Nreturn Al to normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can hide here and do your research, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to take revenge for Hughes-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we won't take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Scar's death \Nwill have been meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's still something \Nthat we must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something more important than revenge, and what you've been searching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow-ow-ow-ow! \NWh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm doing your braid for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That's okay, I'll do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:12:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:03.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not anything dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:17.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, where could Dad have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deterioration of the soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:30.84,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,As our souls have been repeatedly transferred into different bodies, they have eroded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our souls no longer have the power to sustain their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante, we are going to perish like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I just need the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can always take a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will happen again immediately after moving to that body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.71,0:13:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the same will be true of the next body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll move into \Nanother new body!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must have used the last bit I left you \Nto transfer into that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is why those boys have made the next Stone for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Ishbalan man has turned your son \Ninto a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante-sama, then it really is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:15:02.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I saw Edward and Alphonse, I should have realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what they had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I didn't want to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trisha...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will always be dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hohenheim of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that you could be beaten by a homunculus, of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since you left, I've been \Ndoing some research of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That gate, which is the source of power for alchemy—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.91,0:15:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What lies on the other side of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a way \Nto open the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:54.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gate is inside of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:16:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, someone whose bond between body, mind, and soul is still weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:02.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,say, as is the case for this baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is able to call forth the gate \Neven stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:08.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we perform an experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to see what the other side of the gate is like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:31.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tri...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Ed and Al are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are... your children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't ever have to go back to the other side of that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring the Philosopher's Stone here, \NWrath, Sloth, and Lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can be reborn once again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I have the Philosopher's Stone, and after my soul has been bonded,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really will turn \Nyou all into humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:28.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it all depends on my mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here is your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to eat more,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or you won't be able to fit into my dress sizes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Search carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:01.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a possibility that they've changed their hair and eye color.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A large man and a runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The runt is as small as a bean sprout, so don't overlook him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not the one, huh? The one we're searching for is as small as a baby ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:12.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We found an odd bronze sculpture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How big is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks larger than the suit of armor in the dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:22.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, just to be safe, \Nwe'll smash it with a hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:29.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You! You're that man from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:40.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the bean sprout we heard about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:46.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, I can very well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Brother. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.05,0:19:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, don't use any alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:15.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not? I remembered the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can probably do it, \Njust like you do, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know what will happen if you use alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take our time to research it, \Nand I'll return you to your original body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take everything from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.81,0:19:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like that bastard said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone pulling \Nthe strings of the homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I'm going to need \Nin order to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:45.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.17,0:19:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can stay. \NI'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can look after things here by yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:13.40,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,The two of us have been ordered to take command of the expeditionary forces in the north, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They have to know we've been in contact with Ed and Al,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:21.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,because of the matter \Nwith the secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:25.28,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,And yet, they're sending us off to the front, \Nwithout the least bit of censure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they were going to shut us up, \Nthey could just attack us here in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There {\i1}is{\i0} the matter of Hughes, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they were to use the same tactic again, \Nit would arouse suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the battlefield, they can kill us \Nwhenever they please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:41.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, even if they do turn up \Nany documents, they can just sit on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, even now, I can't \Nbelieve that he could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:51.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I read over the materials that Scieszka gave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.43,0:20:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't unravel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:55.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was the final \Npart of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.28,0:20:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've given yourself away, haven't you, \Nyou miserable homunculus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you \Nwould have stayed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You never know what's going on \Nright under your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I wanted to look through \Nsome of the things that Dante had.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:15.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, \Nwhat are you here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it will just \Nget you mad at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something that I absolutely have to get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.19,0:21:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, is there any part of your \Ndead baby's body still remaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:38.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:22:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so... so good of you \Nto come, Alphonse-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:09.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please teach me how to use the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.90,0:23:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 46: "Human Transmutation"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.98,0:23:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to \Nbecome human—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.60,0:23:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,something so worthless?
